      "action": "send_reply(id=\"0XFFeHa2M3KE5RywllJVss\", body=\"Dear Jennifer,\n\nThank you for contacting our support team. I have received your urgent request regarding the API integration issue.\n\nI have created a support case (Case #92) for this issue and assigned it as High Priority (P1) due to the critical nature of this problem affecting your production environment.\n\nYour case details:\n- Subject: API Integration Failing - 500 Errors on /api/v2/sync\n- Priority: High (P1)\n- Status: Open\n\nOur technical team will investigate the 500 errors on the /api/v2/sync endpoint immediately. We understand this is impacting your production environment and will work to resolve this as quickly as possible.\n\nYou will receive updates via email as we make progress on this issue. If you have any additional information or encounter further issues, please reply to this email.\n\nThank you for your patience.\n\nBest regards,\nSupport Team\")",
